  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orientation Visit - BUSINESS ROUNDTABLE AND MINING SITE VISIT, through U.S. Energy Association</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Business Roundtable and mining site tour included senior private and public sector officials accompanying the President of Mongolia on his visit to the U.S. on May 17-18, 2010. The business roundtable included presentations on U.S. mining saftey, coal liquefaction, coal gasification, and mining operations. The briefing provided a forum for the delegates to learn about U.S. mining and electric power technologies, as well as more about USTDA and other U.S. government assistance that may help develop the country&apos;s energy and mining sector.</narrative>
  </description>
